Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@227||26|13|||||ART_message(D5G1;)S["To correctly retain state in Verilog simulation, the masterb and slave nodes",are declared as trireg so that they retain their value when,nothing drives the node during a brief switching transient.,"Also, the slave transmission gate must be declared as weak",so that it doesn't backdrive an X onto master.]
